 *
 * <ul>
 *   <li>Instrument: MES (H1)</li>
 *   <li>Archetype: PULLBACK (BOTH)</li>
 *   <li>Long Signal: Stoch%K(25)[1] &lt; 22 (Oversold)</li>
 *   <li>Short Signal: Stoch%K(25)[1] &gt; 78 (Overbought)</li>
 *   <li>Entry Type: Market Order on Signal Bar Close</li>
 *   <li>Exit Rules: SL: 2.5 × ATR(20) | PT: 5.8 × ATR(20) | Time Exit: 26 bars</li>
